WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.249 --> 00:00:03.951
(bouncy violin music)

00:00:03.951 --> 00:00:07.699
- This has always been an obsession.

00:00:07.699 --> 00:00:10.102
Everybody collects something

00:00:10.102 --> 00:00:13.102
and mine just happens to be antlers.

00:00:23.606 --> 00:00:27.430
(lively chiming music)

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:31.245
My name is Jim Phillips,
and I'm the Antler Man.

00:00:31.245 --> 00:00:33.495
I have over 16,000 antlers.

00:00:35.672 --> 00:00:39.800
I didn't kill all these
animals to get the antlers.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.883
I'm not much of a killer.

00:00:46.097 --> 00:00:50.315
Deer and elk and moose and
antelope shed their antlers

00:00:50.315 --> 00:00:53.732
every year and grow a new set of antlers.

00:00:54.739 --> 00:00:56.448
I just started walkin' out in the hills

00:00:56.448 --> 00:01:00.070
and I would find one and
pick it up and bring it home.

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:02.653
There is no harm to the animal.

00:01:05.017 --> 00:01:07.100
I have good days and bad days.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:11.621
The most deer antlers I
ever found in a day was 87.

00:01:11.621 --> 00:01:15.788
But I've hiked 11 hours
and never found an antler.

00:01:20.489 --> 00:01:24.656
I keep my antlers in a shed
that I built at my house.

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:28.560
It is 60 feet long and 30 feet wide.

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:30.030
There's a pattern to everything in here

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:34.197
and the way the antlers are
laid out, that's the art.

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:40.433
The reason I guess I display
the antlers the way I do,

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:44.696
respect for the antler,
respect for the animal itself.

00:01:44.696 --> 00:01:47.317
The shed may seem full,
but when I look around

00:01:47.317 --> 00:01:50.900
I can still find places
to put the antlers.

00:01:52.679 --> 00:01:56.722
As long as I can get out and
get around in the mountains,

00:01:56.722 --> 00:01:59.029
I'll continue to collect.

00:01:59.029 --> 00:02:03.520
I get the same thrill
today, 59 years later,

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:06.115
as I did when I was a 10-year-old

00:02:06.115 --> 00:02:09.294
and there's very few things
you can say that about.

00:02:09.294 --> 00:02:11.563
My wife has plans on me stopping.

00:02:11.563 --> 00:02:14.151
My daughters have a plan on me stopping,

00:02:14.151 --> 00:02:17.234
but I have no plans on ever stopping.

00:02:23.244 --> 00:02:25.411
(chiming)

